examples.question_text:
A fair coin is tossed three times independently. Its eight complete paths are:
First toss $H$: $HHH,HHT,HTH,HTT$
First toss $T$: $THH,THT,TTH,TTT$
[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[x=1cm,y=1cm,draw=black,text=black,every node/.style={font=\fontsize{10}{12}\selectfont,inner sep=2pt}]
\coordinate (O) at (0,0);
\coordinate (H) at (1.5,1.6);
\coordinate (T) at (1.5,-1.6);
\coordinate (HH) at (3,2.4);
\coordinate (HT) at (3,0.8);
\coordinate (TH) at (3,-0.8);
\coordinate (TT) at (3,-2.4);
\draw (O)--(H) node[midway,above] {$H$};
\draw (O)--(T) node[midway,below] {$T$};
\draw (H)--(HH) node[midway,above] {$H$};
\draw (H)--(HT) node[midway,below] {$T$};
\draw (T)--(TH) node[midway,above] {$H$};
\draw (T)--(TT) node[midway,below] {$T$};
\foreach \parent/\upper/\lower/\word in {HH/2.8/2.0/HH,HT/1.2/0.4/HT,TH/-0.4/-1.2/TH,TT/-2.0/-2.8/TT}{
\draw (\parent)--(4.5,\upper) node[midway,above] {$H$};
\draw (\parent)--(4.5,\lower) node[midway,below] {$T$};
\node at (6.4,\upper) {$\word H$};
\node at (6.4,\lower) {$\word T$};
}
\node at (1.5,3.4) {Toss 1};
\node at (3,3.4) {Toss 2};
\node at (4.5,3.4) {Toss 3};
\node at (6.4,3.4) {Outcome};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Find, as fractions in simplest form:
(a) the probability of exactly two tails
(b) the probability of three tails.
